"Wi‑Fi は Microchip WINC1500 モジュール上で動作し、\\ :doc:`/library/network.WINC` "
"インターフェースを通じて公開されます::"

#: ../../openmvcam/quickref/openmv-pure-thermal.rst:515
msgid ""
"Due to part shortages, **some Pure Thermal units shipped without the "
"WINC1500 module populated**. If :class:`network.WINC` raises an error or "
"never connects, check the board for a missing Wi‑Fi module — the rest of the"
